  "notes": [
    "The book also offers a Regimental Artillery Battery for an infantry regiment of at least 3 battalions, but every Saxon regiment is 1-2 battalions, so it never applies.",
    "The Confederation of the Rhine list's maximums and minimums are per every 1,000 points unless otherwise stated (p. 172). The builder applies them as written, which is right for armies up to 1,000 points; scale them up yourself for larger armies.",
    "The book gives no Saxon half-battery stat lines, so the half batteries use the French ones (p. 154)."
  ],
  "specialRules": [
